personaggi più famosi dell'universo dickensiano, quell'Oliver Twist che ha già costituito una fonte di ispirazione per il cinema.  Polanski legge la vicenda narrata dal grande autore inglese immergendola in una miseria materiale e morale quasi palpabile."},{"id":21842,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":2386,"locale":"it","key":"release_date","value":"2005-09-23"},{"id":21841,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":2386,"locale":"it","key":"slug","value":"oliver-twist"},{"id":21844,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":2386,"locale":"it","key":"views","value":"96098"}],"keywords":[{"id":41,"name":"street gang","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:50.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:50.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":2386,"keyword_id":41}},{"id":74,"name":"based on novel or book","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:55.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":2386,"keyword_id":74}},{"id":160,"name":"england","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:49:08.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:49:08.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":2386,"keyword_id":160}},{"id":252,"name":"violence","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:49:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:49:49.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":2386,"keyword_id":252}},{"id":285,"name":"london","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:06.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":2386,"keyword_id":285}},{"id":1397,"name":"child abuse","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:40.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":2386,"keyword_id":1397}},{"id":1453,"name":"good and bad","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:53.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":2386,"keyword_id":1453}},{"id":1575,"name":"thief","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:56:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:56:30.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":2386,"keyword_id":1575}},{"id":1835,"name":"child","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:57:41.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:57:41.0